<h2>Check Your Understanding (Scenario Questions)</h2>

<div class="callout">
<strong>Scenario A:</strong> You want to add a new SDR type — a hypothetical "FooSDR". List the files you'd create/modify and the minimum changes required.
<br><br>
<em>Think it through, then expand:</em> <a href="#" id="toggleA" style="color:var(--cyan)">show answer</a>
<div id="ansA" hidden style="margin-top:0.75rem; color:var(--green)">
1. Create <code>sdr_foosdr.c</code> and <code>sdr_foosdr.h</code> implementing <code>foosdrInitConfig</code>, <code>foosdrHandleOption</code>, <code>foosdrOpen</code>, <code>foosdrRun</code>, <code>foosdrClose</code>.<br>
