3. Add a row to <code>sdr_handlers[]</code> in <code>sdr.c</code>, guarded by <code>#ifdef ENABLE_FOOSDR</code>.<br>
4. Add <code>#ifdef ENABLE_FOOSDR / #include "sdr_foosdr.h" / #endif</code> at the top of <code>sdr.c</code>.<br>
